<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>ALYA - Centre d'appels B2B premium</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="ALYA, centre d'appels B2B premium basé à Strasbourg. Prospection, prise de rendez-vous qualifiés, fidélisation et recouvrement amiable pour PME et ETI." />

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-main: #05070b;
      --bg-alt: #0b1018;
      --primary: #00e0d6;
      --primary-soft: rgba(0, 224, 214, 0.18);
      --accent: #2bb1ff;
      --text-main: #f5f7fb;
      --text-muted: #a4afc3;
      --border-subtle: #182130;
      --danger: #ff4d6a;
      --radius-lg: 18px;
      --radius-md: 12px;
      --radius-pill: 999px;
      --shadow-soft: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
      --shadow-chip: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #0c1724 0%, #05070b 55%, #020308 100%);
      color: var(--text-main);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    .page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px 20px 60px;
    }

    /* HEADER */

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(5,7,11,0.96) 60%, rgba(5,7,11,0.75) 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(40, 55, 80, 0.65);
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 6px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 0, #00f6ff 0, #0077ff 40%, #05070b 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .brand-logo img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .brand-text {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2px;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .brand-tagline {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    nav a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      padding: 6px 0;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .nav-cta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 550;
      cursor: pointer;
      background: none;
      color: var(--text-main);
      transition: all 0.18s ease-out;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
      color: #020308;
      border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 26px 70px rgba(0, 160, 200, 0.45);
    }

    .btn-ghost {
      border-color: rgba(81, 103, 142, 0.8);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(255,255,255,0.09), rgba(3,6,12,0.9));
      color: var(--text-muted);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-chip);
    }

    .btn-ghost:hover {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    /* HERO */

    main {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .hero {
      padding-top: 40px;
      padding-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 0.95fr);
      gap: 36px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 224, 214, 0.36);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(0, 224, 214, 0.15), rgba(5,7,11,0.92));
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-chip);
    }

    .badge-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 224, 214, 0.7);
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .hero-title span {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 520px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .hero-note {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .hero-note span {
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .hero-meta {
      margin-top: 22px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .meta-chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      border: 1px solid rgba(45, 68, 104, 0.9);
      background: rgba(6, 10, 18, 0.96);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-chip);
    }

    .meta-chip-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent);
    }

    /* HERO CARD RIGHT */

    .hero-card {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #101a26, #05070b);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 20px 20px 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: -120px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 10% -10%, rgba(0, 224, 214, 0.16), transparent 62%);
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-card-inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .logo-large {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .logo-large img {
      width: 160px;
      height: 160px;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 28px 48px rgba(0, 224, 214, 0.45));
    }

    .hero-card-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .hero-card-main {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .hero-card-main span {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .hero-card-divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(93, 117, 158, 0.8), transparent);
      margin: 14px 0;
    }

    .hero-stats {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .stat {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid rgba(63, 88, 132, 0.9);
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, rgba(8,13,24,0.96), rgba(3,6,12,0.98));
    }

    .stat-label {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .stat-value {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 550;
    }

    .stat-value span {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .hero-card-footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .hero-card-footnote {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .hero-card-footnote span {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .hero-badge-secure {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 224, 214, 0.35);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(0,224,214,0.16), rgba(5,7,11,0.96));
    }

    /* SECTIONS */

    section {
      padding: 36px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(24, 33, 48, 0.9);
    }

    .section-header {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .section-kicker {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .section-desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* BENEFITS */

    .benefits-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .benefit {
      padding: 14px 14px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(255,255,255,0.03), rgba(5,7,11,0.98));
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .benefit-icon {
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, var(--primary), var(--accent));
      color: #020308;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(0, 224, 214, 0.5);
    }

    .benefit-title {
      font-weight: 550;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .benefit-text {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* SERVICES */

    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
    }

    .service {
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(0, 224, 214, 0.06), rgba(5,7,11,0.98));
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
    }

    .service-name {
      font-weight: 550;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .service-text {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* PROCESS */

    .process-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
    }

    .step {
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(255,255,255,0.03), rgba(5,7,11,0.98));
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
      position: relative;
    }

    .step-number {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .step-title {
      font-weight: 550;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .step-text {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* CONTACT / CTA SECTION */

    .contact-card {
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding: 18px 18px 16px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,224,214,0.4);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(0,224,214,0.14), rgba(5,7,11,0.98));
      box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .contact-left-title {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .contact-left-text {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .contact-mini {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .contact-mini span {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .contact-form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    .field-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .field {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    label {
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    input, textarea {
      background: rgba(3,6,12,0.96);
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(61, 82, 122, 0.95);
      padding: 8px 10px;
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.16s ease-out, box-shadow 0.16s ease-out, background 0.16s ease-out;
    }

    input:focus, textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 224, 214, 0.6);
      background: rgba(3,8,16,0.98);
    }

    textarea {
      resize: vertical;
      min-height: 80px;
    }

    .form-footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .form-note {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .form-note span {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    /* FOOTER */

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(24, 33, 48, 0.9);
      padding: 18px 0 28px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .hero-grid {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }

      .hero-card {
        order: -1;
      }

      .benefits-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .services-grid,
      .process-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .contact-card {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }

      header {
        position: static;
      }

      nav {
        display: none;
      }

      .container {
        padding-inline: 16px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .benefits-grid,
      .services-grid,
      .process-grid {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }

      .hero-stats {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .field-row {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: stretch;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <div class="container header-inner">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="brand-logo">
            <!-- Remplace src par le chemin réel de ton image -->
            <img src="ChatGPT-Image-6-mai-2026-14_50_36.jpg" alt="Logo ALYA" />
          </div>
          <div class="brand-text">
            <div class="brand-name">ALYA</div>
            <div class="brand-tagline">Votre solution, notre priorité</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="nav-cta">
          <nav>
            <a href="#services">Services</a>
            <a href="#process">Méthode</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
          </nav>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Planifier un diagnostic</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <!-- HERO -->
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="badge">
              <div class="badge-dot"></div>
              <span>Centre d'appels B2B premium &nbsp;·&nbsp; Strasbourg</span>
            </div>

            <h1 class="hero-title">
              Plus de rendez-vous <span>qualifiés</span><br />
              sans recruter un seul commercial de plus.
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-subtitle">
              ALYA accompagne les PME, ETI et acteurs du secteur automobile à transformer leurs leads et leurs portefeuilles clients en chiffre d’affaires supplémentaire, avec une équipe de téléprospection 100&nbsp;% France.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Planifier un diagnostic de 30&nbsp;minutes</a>
              <a href="#services" class="btn btn-ghost">Découvrir nos services</a>
            </div>

            <p class="hero-note">
              <span>Diagnostic offert</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; aucun engagement &nbsp;·&nbsp; rapport d’opportunités concret.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-meta">
              <div class="meta-chip">
                <div class="meta-chip-dot"></div>
                <span>Spécialisation : B2B et secteur automobile (grossistes, garagistes, fournisseurs).</span>
              </div>
              <div class="meta-chip">
                <div class="meta-chip-dot" style="background: var(--primary);"></div>
                <span>Conforme RGPD & Bloctel &nbsp;·&nbsp; scripts sur‑mesure.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <aside class="hero-card">
            <div class="hero-card-inner">
              <div class="logo-large">
                <img src="ChatGPT-Image-6-mai-2026-14_50_36.jpg" alt="ALYA logo" />
              </div>
              <div class="hero-card-title">Votre solution, notre priorité</div>
              <div class="hero-card-main">
                Une équipe <span>B2B</span> dédiée à vos rendez‑vous commerciaux.
              </div>

              <div class="hero-card-divider"></div>

              <div class="hero-stats">
                <div class="stat">
                  <div class="stat-label">Formule forfait</div>
                  <div class="stat-value">
                    À partir de <span>6&nbsp;000&nbsp;€ HT</span><br />/ mois
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                  <div class="stat-label">Formule au succès</div>
                  <div class="stat-value">
                    <span>150&nbsp;€</span> par rendez‑vous<br />qualifié
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="hero-card-footer">
                <div class="hero-card-footnote">
                  Choisissez le modèle adapté à votre stratégie : <span>volume de RDV</span> ou <span>maîtrise du risque</span>.
                </div>
                <div class="hero-badge-secure">
                  <span style="font-size: 0.9rem;">✔</span>
                  <span>Contrat clair & transparent</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- BENEFITS -->
      <section id="benefits">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-header">
            <div class="section-kicker">Pourquoi ALYA</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Un partenaire de croissance, pas un simple plateau d’appels.</h2>
            <p class="section-desc">
              Vous gardez vos équipes commerciales concentrées sur les rendez‑vous et la signature, nous gérons la prospection, la relance et la qualification avec une approche premium orientée résultat.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="benefits-grid">
            <div class="benefit">
              <div class="benefit-icon">↑</div>
              <div class="benefit-title">Plus de rendez‑vous qualifiés</div>
              <div class="benefit-text">
                Pipelines remplis par des rendez‑vous réellement exploitables pour vos commerciaux terrain, avec des critères de qualification définis ensemble.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="benefit">
              <div class="benefit-icon">🇫🇷</div>
              <div class="benefit-title">Équipe 100&nbsp;% France</div>
              <div class="benefit-text">
                Téléopérateurs basés à Strasbourg, francophones natifs, formés à la prospection B2B exigeante et au respect de votre image de marque.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="benefit">
              <div class="benefit-icon">⚙</div>
              <div class="benefit-title">Scripts & ciblage sur‑mesure</div>
              <div class="benefit-text">
                Prise en compte de vos offres, de vos personas et de votre cycle de vente pour maximiser la pertinence de chaque appel sortant.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="benefit">
              <div class="benefit-icon">📊</div>
              <div class="benefit-title">Reporting transparent</div>
              <div class="benefit-text">
                Suivi clair : volumes d’appels, taux de prise de rendez‑vous, motifs de refus, opportunités détectées pour ajuster en continu.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="benefit">
